{"seq":2,"slug":"surgical-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 外科护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing/surgical-nursing","wordCount":2041,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学护理学-外科护理\">大学护理学 — 外科护理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>外科护理以围手术期（围术期）护理为核心，涵盖术前准备、术中配合和术后康复全过程的系统化护理。外科患者面临手术创伤、麻醉风险和术后并发症等多重挑战，护士在其中扮演着评估者、执行者、教育者和协调者的多重角色。随着快速康复外科（ERAS）理念的推广，外科护理正从被动应对并发症向主动预防和加速康复转变。掌握外科护理的核心原则和关键技术，是成为合格外科护士的必备条件。</p>\n<p>核心知识领域：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>围手术期护理</strong>：术前评估与准备、术后监护与并发症预防</li>\n<li><strong>麻醉后护理</strong>：全身麻醉和椎管内麻醉的术后观察要点</li>\n<li><strong>伤口与引流管理</strong>：伤口愈合评估、各类引流管的护理</li>\n<li><strong>外科常见并发症</strong>：出血、感染、深静脉血栓、肠麻痹</li>\n<li><strong>快速康复外科（ERAS）</strong>：循证康复策略</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-术前护理\">一、术前护理</h3><p>术前护理的目标是全面评估患者状况，尽可能降低手术和麻醉风险，同时减轻患者焦虑。</p>\n<p><strong>术前评估内容</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>具体内容</th>\n<th>护理意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手术风险</td>\n<td>ASA 分级（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>I</mtext><mo>∼</mo><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{I} \\sim \\text{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span></span></span></span></span> 级）、心肺功能</td>\n<td>预判并发症风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营养状态</td>\n<td>BMI、血清白蛋白、NRS-2002 评分</td>\n<td>白蛋白 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> g/L 提示高风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凝血功能</td>\n<td>PT、APTT、INR、血小板</td>\n<td>评估出血风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用药史</td>\n<td>抗凝药、降糖药、抗高血压药</td>\n<td>术前调整方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心理状态</td>\n<td>焦虑、恐惧、信息需求</td>\n<td>针对性心理护理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>术前准备清单</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>术前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 小时禁食、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 小时禁饮（ERAS 方案允许术前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小时饮清液 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> mL）</li>\n<li>手术区域皮肤准备（必要时备皮，目前推荐术日在手术室使用电动剪刀而非刮刀）</li>\n<li>术前用药：遵医嘱给予预防性抗生素（切皮前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30 \\sim 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</li>\n<li>术前谈话与知情同意：确认手术同意书已签署</li>\n<li>安全核查：手术部位标记、患者身份确认（腕带）、过敏史确认</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-术后护理\">二、术后护理</h3><p><strong>全身麻醉术后护理</strong>：</p>\n<p>全麻术后患者从手术室返回病房时，可能处于不同程度的意识恢复阶段。护理优先级遵循 ABC 原则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>A（Airway）</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>B（Breathing）</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>C（Circulation）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{A（Airway）} &gt; \\text{B（Breathing）} &gt; \\text{C（Circulation）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">Airway</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">Breathing</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">Circulation</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>气道管理</strong>：去枕平卧、头偏一侧（防误吸）；保留气管插管者监测气囊压力；完全清醒且保护性反射恢复后方可拔管</li>\n<li><strong>呼吸监测</strong>：持续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 监测，频率异常时评估呼吸抑制（残余肌松、阿片类药物效应）</li>\n<li><strong>循环监测</strong>：连续心电监护，密切观察血压、心率；术后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> h 内每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15 \\sim 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟记录一次生命体征</li>\n<li><strong>意识评估</strong>：Aldrete 评分系统评估恢复程度（活动、呼吸、循环、意识、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，总分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 分可转出恢复室）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>椎管内麻醉术后护理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>去枕平卧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 小时（预防头痛）</li>\n<li>监测下肢感觉和运动恢复情况</li>\n<li>观察尿潴留——交感神经阻滞影响膀胱功能</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三-伤口与引流管理\">三、伤口与引流管理</h3><p><strong>伤口愈合分类</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一期愈合</td>\n<td>切缘对合整齐、无感染</td>\n<td>清洁手术切口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二期愈合</td>\n<td>肉芽组织填充、瘢痕较大</td>\n<td>感染伤口、慢性溃疡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三期愈合</td>\n<td>先开放引流后再缝合</td>\n<td>污染伤口的延期缝合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>伤口评估 TIME 框架</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>T</strong>（Tissue）：组织类型——坏死、肉芽、上皮</li>\n<li><strong>I</strong>（Infection/Inflammation）：感染/炎症征象</li>\n<li><strong>M</strong>（Moisture）：渗液量和性质</li>\n<li><strong>E</strong>（Edge）：伤口边缘推进情况</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>引流管护理原则</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[引流管护理] --&gt; B[固定妥善]&#10;    A --&gt; C[保持通畅]&#10;    A --&gt; D[观察引流物]&#10;    A --&gt; E[无菌操作]&#10;    A --&gt; F[记录出入量]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[双重固定: 缝线+胶布]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[避免扭曲/受压/折叠]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[颜色/量/性质变化]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[更换引流袋时严格无菌]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[每班记录引流量]\">graph TD\n    A[引流管护理] --&gt; B[固定妥善]\n    A --&gt; C[保持通畅]\n    A --&gt; D[观察引流物]\n    A --&gt; E[无菌操作]\n    A --&gt; F[记录出入量]\n    B --&gt; B1[双重固定: 缝线+胶布]\n    C --&gt; C1[避免扭曲/受压/折叠]\n    D --&gt; D1[颜色/量/性质变化]\n    E --&gt; E1[更换引流袋时严格无菌]\n    F --&gt; F1[每班记录引流量]</pre><p>常见引流管及护理要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>胸腔闭式引流</strong>：水封瓶液面低于引流管胸壁出口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60 \\sim 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> cm，观察水柱波动（正常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\sim 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> cm）</li>\n<li><strong>腹腔引流</strong>：注意引流液颜色——鲜红色提示活动性出血，胆汁样提示胆漏</li>\n<li><strong>T 管引流</strong>：胆总管手术后留置，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 天左右夹管试验后造影确认无残余结石方可拔管</li>\n<li><strong>尿管</strong>：每日评估拔管指征（尽量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24 \\sim 48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span></span> h 内拔除），预防导管相关泌尿道感染（CAUTI）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-术后并发症的预防与护理\">四、术后并发症的预防与护理</h3><p><strong>深静脉血栓（DVT）预防</strong>——Virchow 三联征（血流淤滞、血管壁损伤、高凝状态）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预防措施</th>\n<th>具体方法</th>\n<th>证据级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>早期活动</td>\n<td>术后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> h 开始踝泵运动</td>\n<td>强推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机械预防</td>\n<td>间歇性气压泵（IPC）、弹力袜</td>\n<td>强推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>药物预防</td>\n<td>低分子肝素皮下注射</td>\n<td>中高风险必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>充分补液</td>\n<td>避免脱水导致血液浓缩</td>\n<td>基础措施</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DVT 的早期识别：患肢肿胀、疼痛、Homan 征阳性（被动背伸踝关节时腓肠肌疼痛）。一旦怀疑 DVT，应立即卧床避免活动患肢（防止栓子脱落），通知医生安排超声检查。</p>\n<p><strong>手术部位感染（SSI）预防</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>术前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟预防性抗生素</li>\n<li>术中严格无菌、控制手术时间</li>\n<li>术后按时更换敷料、评估切口</li>\n<li>控制血糖（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>11.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 11.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11.1</span></span></span></span></span> mmol/L）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"五-快速康复外科-eras\">五、快速康复外科（ERAS）</h3><p>ERAS 是以循证医学为基础的围术期管理优化方案，核心目标是减少手术应激反应、加速术后康复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传统做法</th>\n<th>ERAS 推荐</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>术前长时间禁食</td>\n<td>术前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> h 可饮含糖清液</td>\n<td>减少胰岛素抵抗、改善舒适度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常规肠道准备</td>\n<td>多数手术不需要</td>\n<td>肠道准备增加脱水和电解质紊乱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>术后长期卧床</td>\n<td>术后当天即可下床</td>\n<td>减少 DVT、肺不张风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>术后禁食至排气</td>\n<td>术后早期经口进食</td>\n<td>促进肠功能恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常规留置鼻胃管</td>\n<td>不常规留置</td>\n<td>减少不适和肺部并发症</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常规留置尿管</td>\n<td>尽早拔除（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> h 内）</td>\n<td>减少 CAUTI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一位全麻术后返回病房的患者，Aldrete 评分：活动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、呼吸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>、循环 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>、意识 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，总分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 分。分析各项得分含义，并说明需要重点监护的内容。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某腹部手术患者术后第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天出现切口红肿、压痛、体温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>38.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">38.5°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">38.5°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>。分析最可能的并发症，描述护理评估步骤和处理措施。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一位髋关节置换术后患者拒绝下床活动。运用 ERAS 理念向患者解释早期活动的重要性，并设计渐进式活动计划。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>胸腔闭式引流管护理中，水封瓶中的水柱不再波动。分析可能的原因（至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个），以及护士应如何逐一排查。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较传统围术期管理与 ERAS 方案在术前禁食、术后进食和术后活动三个方面的差异，讨论 ERAS 在中国推广的现实挑战。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《外科护理学》</strong>（曹伟新、李乐之主编）：国内护理本科核心教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Brunner &amp; Suddarth&#39;s Textbook of Medical-Surgical Nursing&quot;</strong>：英文内外科护理经典</li>\n<li><strong>ERAS Society Guidelines</strong> (<a href=\"https://erassociety.org)：各专科\">https://erassociety.org)：各专科</a> ERAS 方案的官方指南</li>\n<li><strong>WHO Surgical Safety Checklist</strong>：世界卫生组织手术安全核查表</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Evidence-Based Practice in Nursing&quot; (Brown)</strong>：将循证方法融入护理实践</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>外科护理的精髓在于围术期管理的系统化和并发症预防的前瞻性。术前全面评估和充分准备是手术安全的基础，术后 ABC 优先级管理确保危及生命的问题得到最先处理，伤口和引流管的规范护理促进恢复并早期发现异常，DVT 和 SSI 的预防则体现了护理的主动预防理念。ERAS 代表了外科护理的最新发展方向——从经验性常规走向循证实践，从被动等待恢复走向主动促进康复。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学护理学 — 外科护理","id":"大学护理学-外科护理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、术前护理","id":"一-术前护理"},{"level":3,"text":"二、术后护理","id":"二-术后护理"},{"level":3,"text":"三、伤口与引流管理","id":"三-伤口与引流管理"},{"level":3,"text":"四、术后并发症的预防与护理","id":"四-术后并发症的预防与护理"},{"level":3,"text":"五、快速康复外科（ERAS）","id":"五-快速康复外科-eras"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学护理学 — 内科护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing/medical-nursing"},"next":{"title":"大学护理学 — 儿科护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing/pediatric-nursing"}}